  "body": "There's something special about finding a home that offers the perfect balance of modern comfort, easy living and a wonderful sense of community. Somewhere you can enjoy your morning coffee, entertain friends on the deck or simply enjoy a home that's been thoughtfully designed. Welcome to 299E Pinecrest Drive, Gulf Harbour. \r\n\r\nNot even two years old yet, this classic low-maintenance weatherboard home split across 206sqm of floor area offers four bedrooms, a fantastic single-level layout, generous living spaces and beautiful views across Gulf Harbour. Whether you're looking to upsize, downsize or find the perfect place for your family, this home is well worth a look. The current owners have already secured their next property, so their plans are firmly in place and this home must be sold!\r\n\r\nWhat's To Love:\r\n- Four bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, a main bathroom and a separate guest toilet\r\n- A spacious kitchen with plenty of storage, excellent bench space and a huge separate scullery\r\n- Open-plan living with a 2.7m stud, creating a great sense of space throughout\r\n- Two heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n- Beautiful views across Gulf Harbour\r\n- A generous outdoor deck with an added louvre system, perfect for BBQs, entertaining or enjoying your morning coffee or afternoon wine\r\n- A flat, fully fenced backyard, ideal for children and pets\r\n- Fully tiled bathrooms with underfloor heating\r\n- Double internal-access garage with additional storage\r\n\r\nBeyond your front gate, Gulf Harbour offers a fantastic lifestyle and a genuine sense of community. With the marina, local cafés, restaurants and coastal walkways nearby, there's plenty to enjoy. The Gulf Harbour Ferry Terminal also provides a convenient connection across the water to Auckland, making commuting or heading into the city easy.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a growing family, retirees looking for easy single-level living or simply wanting a modern home in a great location, 299E Pinecrest Drive ticks plenty of boxes.\r\n\r\nWith the owners committed to their next move, this is an opportunity not to be missed. Come and experience the Gulf Harbour lifestyle for yourself. Call Nicole Donovan for more information or visit us at the open homes this weekend!\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale Closes: Thursday 3rd December at 2:00pm (unless sold prior)",
